    "intro_narrative": "The year is 2084. The world was scorched by nuclear fire decades ago. As a scavenger navigating the toxic wasteland, you've discovered the legendary 'Echo Bunker'—a pre-war communications hub rumored to still have satellite uplink capabilities. However, its systems are completely locked down and fragmented. Your radiation suit is failing, and a deadly rad-storm is approaching. You must scavenge the facility, chain together the surviving operational modules, and reboot the system to transmit an SOS to the surviving orbital station before the storm consumes you entirely.",
    "narrative_style": "post_apocalyptic"
  },
